The function catalogs used to be read directly from a copy of the EXPath
repository, but QT4 has incorporated the file and binary modules directly into
XPath. Mirroring the QT4 repository seems would be fiddly, so this directory
just has copies of the relevant function catalogs.

To simplify things, the archive catalog is also copied here, although
technically it could still be read from the EXPath repository.
